    },
    {
      q: 'What is Urge Surfing and why is it superior to sheer willpower?',
      a: 'Pioneered by Dr. G. Alan Marlatt, Urge Surfing treats cravings as ocean waves that peak within 2-3 minutes and dissolve. Instead of fighting impulses with exhausting willpower, you mindfully observe sensations until the wave subsides.',
    },
    {
      q: 'Why is ForgeEnergy 100% client-side with zero server storage?',
